he air conditioner is reaching them  in the back of the car so they don't get  too hot in the car  yeah and those are all really good tips  especially because obviously  you know our pets really don't talk but  they do have different  um signs that they sometimes will tell  us that something is wrong so just kind  of keep a close eye on all of them  especially when you're walking them out  during the next couple of months now we  did speak to fire rescue recently who  reminded us  that if we see any type of pets outside  in a hot parked car to contact the  authorities why  is this so important to take action not  just look the other way when something  like this happens  because we know it can kill them it can  kill humans and it can kill animals and  there's  all too many stories of it happening of  beloved pets people go  they think well let me just run it in  i'm going to crack the window down and  i'm going to run in real quick  cracking the window is not enough to get  enough air flow  and those the cars in the summer  are like ovens and it doesn't take but a  few minutes to reach hot enough  to to put them into a heat exhaustion  and sometimes they don't come back from  that  so just don't do it make sure you  remember you've got a kid or a pet in  the car  and just don't leave them in the car if  you're running in even for just a minute  yeah it only takes just a couple of  minutes like you said for that can  really  make a big difference um with our pets  outside  in the heat now finally doctor let me  ask you it's all often  that we report on animal abuse and  neglect during the summer months  of people leaving their pets out in the  hot sun with no fresh water no shade  what would you like pet owners to know  about the subject  personally i'd like to see all pets  inside during the summer and if they're  going to go outside make sure they've  got adequate protection  from the sun they've got fresh water if  they're going to be outside  and live outside make sure they've got  shade make sure they've got airflow make  sure they've got  fresh clean water and then mostly pay  attention to your  pets love on them give them attention  but check on them check their water  check their  their their surroundings check their  bedding just keep an  eye on your pet like you would any  individual who can't take care of  themselves  all right dr jamie oginski thank you so  much for talking to us this afternoon  uh and those are some great tips uh that  you have for all of us i mean especially  for our little fur babies like i said  they sometimes don't talk  but there's different ways of them  telling us that hey you know it's too  hot just maybe turn up that ac in your  car  thank you so much for talking to us  we'll talk to you soon thank you so much
 

